flowchart LR
    START[Application needs a hostname] --> BROWSER{Browser cache or open connection?}
    BROWSER -->|yes| USE[Reuse cached address or connection]
    BROWSER -->|no| HOSTS{Local hosts entry?}
    HOSTS -->|yes| LOCAL[Use local mapping]
    HOSTS -->|no| STUB[Ask operating system resolver]
    STUB --> REC{Recursive resolver cache hit?}
    REC -->|yes| ANSWER[Return cached record and remaining TTL]
    REC -->|no| ROOT[Recursive resolver asks DNS root]
    ROOT --> TLD[Root refers to TLD nameservers]
    TLD --> AUTH[TLD refers to authoritative zone servers]
    AUTH --> TYPE{Authoritative result}
    TYPE -->|A AAAA or CNAME| FOUND[Return positive answer and TTL]
    TYPE -->|NXDOMAIN or NODATA| NEG[Return valid negative answer; negative-cache TTL may apply]
    AUTH -. timeout or unreachable .-> RETRY[Resolver may retry another authoritative server]
    RETRY --> AUTH
    ANSWER --> USE
    FOUND --> USE
    NEG --> FAIL[Name or requested record is absent]
    LOCAL --> USE